## 7. Palindrome Check (Number)

```java
public class Palindrome {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int num = 121;
        int original = num, rev = 0;

        while (num != 0) {
            rev = rev * 10 + num % 10;
            num /= 10;
        }

        System.out.println(original == rev ? "Palindrome" : "Not Palindrome");
    }
}
