## 12. Prime Numbers (2 to 30)

```java
public class PrimeNumbers {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        for (int num = 2; num <= 30; num++) {
            boolean isPrime = true;
            for (int i = 2; i <= Math.sqrt(num); i++) {
                if (num % i == 0) {
                    isPrime = false;
                    break;
                }
            }
            if (isPrime) System.out.print(num + " ");
        }
    }
}
```

