## 14. Armstrong Number

```java
public class Armstrong {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int n = 153, original = n, sum = 0;

        while (n > 0) {
            int d = n % 10;
            sum += d * d * d;
            n /= 10;
        }
        System.out.println(sum == original ? "Armstrong" : "Not Armstrong");
    }
}
```

