## 15. Linear Search

```java
public class LinearSearch {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] a = {10, 15, 24, 68};
        int search = 15;
        boolean found = false;

        for (int i = 0; i < a.length; i++) {
            if (a[i] == search) {
                System.out.println("Found at index " + i);
                found = true;
                break;
            }
        }
